Pin driver for the GS201 SoC of the Google Pixel 7

The driver 'gs201_pio' provides the GPIO lines and pin interrupts of the
GPIO controllers in the devices ROM as Pin_state, Pin_control, and IRQ
sessions, and configures pins as listed in its configuration.

It is part of the scenarios 'run/exynos_fb_pixel', 'run/ft3658_touch_pixel',
and 'run/keys_pixel'.
